<title>UK: Keller wins $16 mln U.S. highway contract.</title>
<headline>Keller wins $16 mln U.S. highway contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering firm Keller Group Plc said on Wednesday it had won a $16 million contract to construct drilled shafts for a highway interchange in Boston, Massachusetts, U.S.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
